\import{fcap-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\tag{fcap}
\tag{spin}
\tag{clifford}

\taxon{Example}
\title{For #{\mathfrak{sl}_2}, the two Clifford actions have different constituents}

\p{Take the basis #{e,f,h} of #{\mathfrak{sl}_2(\mathbb C)} with

##{[h,e]=2e,\qquad [h,f]=-2f,\qquad [e,f]=h.}

The Killing form satisfies
#{\kappa(e,f)=4} and #{\kappa(h,h)=8}. Hence the Clifford relations are

##{e^2=f^2=0,\qquad ef+fe=8,\qquad h^2=8,\qquad
he=-eh,\quad hf=-fh.}

Substitution in the lift of \ref{fcap-003E} gives

##{E=\delta(e)=\frac{he}{8},\qquad
F=\delta(f)=\frac{fh}{8},\qquad
H=\delta(h)=\frac{ef-fe}{8}=\frac{ef}{4}-1.}

Direct Clifford multiplication yields

##{E^2=F^2=0,\qquad H^2=1,\qquad
EF=\frac{1+H}{2},\qquad FE=\frac{1-H}{2}.}

Thus #{E,F,EF,FE} are the four matrix units of the lifted
#{\mathfrak{sl}_2} action.}

\p{For left multiplication, the #{H=+1} and #{H=-1} subspaces are
interchanged by #{F} and #{E}; the two maps are inverse on the
corresponding projected spaces because #{EF} and #{FE} are their
identity projectors. They have equal dimension, and
#{\dim\Cl(Q_\kappa)=8}, so each has dimension four. Choosing a basis of
the positive space and its #{F}-images displays

##{(\Cl(Q_\kappa),L)\simeq4V_1,}

four copies of the standard two-dimensional module.}

\p{For the commutator action #{D}, antisymmetrization identifies the
same vector space with #{\bigwedge\mathfrak{sl}_2}. The exterior powers
are

##{\bigwedge^0\mathfrak g\simeq V_0,\qquad
\bigwedge^1\mathfrak g\simeq V_2,\qquad
\bigwedge^2\mathfrak g\simeq V_2,\qquad
\bigwedge^3\mathfrak g\simeq V_0,}

where the middle identification uses the bracket and the last uses the
invariant volume. Therefore

##{(\Cl(Q_\kappa),D)\simeq2V_0\oplus2V_2.}

The dimensions agree but the characters do not.
\citet{Theorem 39, pp. 312--313}{kostant1997clifford} gives the first
answer through Kostant's primary-type theorem.
\citet{Example 2.5(1), internal preprint p. 8}{panyushev2001exterior}
independently gives the exterior decomposition. The displayed matrix-unit
calculation directly verifies which action produces which answer.}
